[{"id":166543988,"discussion_id":"17f19f1bcd993194ed8ebcd41b08289cc620374f","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317), [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2) (2/2) | ✅ [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317), [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n xingtaowu, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-26T21:43:57+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-28T09:31:40+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166544008,"discussion_id":"b191b4ac330a9e93745c48be26e725afe5143c17","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-26T21:44:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-26T21:44:05+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166544142,"discussion_id":"9a5de9fa3fd8f8ad6f430e552ec3934c7487407f","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR为`scatter_nd_update`算子内核代码添加了索引边界检查功能，旨在修复一个潜在的安全漏洞。原实现中，当`indices`张量中的索引值超出目标变量`var`的有效范围（小于0或大于等于对应轴维度大小）时，内核会无条件执行内存写入，导致数组越界访问，可能引发未定义行为、数据损坏或程序崩溃。该修复提升了算子在处理非法索引时的鲁棒性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案的核心是在数据回写（`CopyOut`）的关键路径上增加索引有效性检查。具体为，在`ScatterNdUpdateBase`类的`CopyOutSplitAfter`和`CopyOutSplitAfterWithSort`函数，以及`ScatterNdUpdateSimd`和`ScatterNdUpdateSimdMask`两个SIMD内核实现中，在执行数据复制前，先判断计算出的索引值是否在`[0, varInAxis)`的有效范围内。仅当索引有效时才执行更新操作，否则跳过。此修改通过新增成员变量`varInAxis_`或从tiling数据获取边界值来实现，对合法索引的性能影响极小，未改变原有核心算法逻辑。","created_at":"2026-03-26T21:45:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-26T21:45:21+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166544489,"discussion_id":"214925b9d9ed9f7a7a46dc31102e0e543d4e6f5a","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-26T21:47:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-26T21:47:50+08:00","user":{"id":"683967dc81eef356e142a072","login":"xingtaowu","object_id":"683967dc81eef356e142a072","name":"xingtaowu","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xingtaowu"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166544603,"discussion_id":"ac5bef321fbc1f895f6952f86f58a5e4688f1ca2","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=b582e6c0e2c54a3f8168601c5b292c24&pipelineRunId=af42fa9a0b614ffeb8bf875f7bc15f3e&projectName=CANN'>af42fa9a0b614ffeb8bf8